<title>CANADA: Suzy Shier plans to buy Woolworth unit.</title>
<headline>Suzy Shier plans to buy Woolworth unit.</headline>
<dateline>DORVAL, Quebec 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzy Shier Ltd said its lingerie unit La Senza Inc is in negotiations to acquire the Silk and Satin lingerie division of Woolworth Canada Inc, a unit of Woolworth Corp.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed.</p>
<p>Suzy Shier said it expects to complete the transaction in mid-October.</p>
<p>La Senza has 121 stores while Silk and Satin has 42.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
